#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Duty Board v3.115.0 — Accounts 3: Banking & Reconciliation (pass 3 of 8).

The outside witness: bank accounts and payment modes, the
reconciliation ritual, working the differences, cash and petty cash
discipline, the POS cash-up chain, and bank governance. Manual depth
from birth: 9 chapters, 35-bank.

Deploy: apply -> commit -> then on the server:
  bench --site xlevel.clouderp.one execute duty_board.academy_seed_accounts_pro.seed_accounts_pro_track

Anchored, idempotent. Requires v3.114.0.
Run from ~/frappe-bench/apps/duty_board.
"""

